Conan holds the rifle with a bellicose air.
"Henry, let's shoot them all! Look at those mugs, they're surely cannibals! Then we'll decide what to do."
You want to rescue Snoopy; the savages' dance does not foreshadow anything good. But Conan's proposal seems very dangerous. Will you be able to defeat a group of strong armed men, even if they are armed only with spears and clubs? After all, they are not wild beasts, but humans. Is there no other way?